positions.description:
SAMIK provides an integrated transportation, warehousing, handling of cargoes and containers as well as international inter-modal freight forwarding by sea and air.

Responsible for steering detail design specifications, coding, testing, and implementation of a fully integrated systems composed of Order entry, Container inventory control, Trailer tracking and Billing systems on the DB2/400 with RPG400 and COBOL400 as the premier language;

• Analyzed user requirements and provided technical leadership in Entity-Relationship data modeling, database design, module architecture and programming during the development process; 

• Developed and maintained EDI mapping programs for shipping orders, container and inventory data transactions with shipping carriers;

• Designed and developed an Executive Information System on the 3-tier architecture implemented on PL/SQL in Oracle Database version 7, DB2/400 and Visual Basic on PC;

• Implemented Graphical User Interface (GUI) for data management between AS400 and PC by using ODBC and Visual Basic;

• Technical Environment:
o AS400: RPG/400, COBOL, CLP, QUERY, SQL400, DFU/RLU/SDA
o Oracle Database, Visual Basic

